<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88019" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμηθ-ής</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμᾱθής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>forethinking,
				provident,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλλησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.82
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμήθεια</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.92
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸν ἔπειτα βίον -έστερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>La.</u>
					188b
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατον σόφισμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					3.2.3
				</span></i>
			 (s.v.l.); <i>troubling oneself, caring about</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ θανεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					1078
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.27.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἀριθμὸς τῶν μυῶν π. ἐξεύρηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					5.14
				</span></i>
			, etc.: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ προμηθέστερον ποιεῖν τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					69
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				1.19.2
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					9.42
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things,
				<i>requiring forethought,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				13
			</span></i> (dub. l.).</div>
